@startuml SSD US 2.2.8 - Create Vessel Visit Notification
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequence {
  ActorBorderColor #000000
  ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
  ParticipantBorderColor #000000
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
  LifeLineBorderColor #000000
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
}

actor "Shipping Agent Representative" as Agent
participant "«system (C4)»\nPort Operations System" as System

activate Agent
Agent -> System : 1: asks to create a Vessel Visit Notification (VVN)
activate System
System --> Agent : 1.1: ask for required data (Vessel, ETA/ETD, cargo manifest, crew info when needed)
deactivate System

Agent -> System : 2: provides VVN data (may be incomplete)
activate System
System --> Agent : 2.1: saves VVN with "in progress" status and displays confirmation
deactivate System

deactivate Agent
@enduml
